DOMAIN-SUFFIX,frontiermyanmar.net,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,rfa.org,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bbc.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,voanews.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,narinjara.com,PROXY
