DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aappb.org,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,khrg.org,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chinhumanrights.org,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,nd-burma.org,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,equalitymyanmar.org,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,earthrights.org,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,freeburmarangers.org,PROXY
